 "remarks": "Ideally located in downtown Greenwich, one block off The Avenue, this one bedroom apartment has it all! Excellent proximity to shopping, dining, metro north, movie theater, Bruce Museum and more - all on foot or bicycle if you like! The apartment is freshly painted, bright and cheerful. Highlights include washer/dryer in the unit, hardwood floors, air conditioning, granite countertops and much more. Off street parking for 1 vehicle. Pets may be considered with an excellent application. As a Greenwich resident you can enjoy all town parks, beaches and events. Must have excellent credit and references.",
